{"version":1,"title":"WORK-LAB 云端审计与 Observer 全量重构架构报告","backing_conversation_id":"6a81c7c4-9ea8-83ea-a894-62ecad0127db","widget_session_id":"0af9a09c-ce22-45e5-b373-89918f99e028","widget_state":{"status":"completed","is_static_preview":true,"report_message":{"id":"855f2779-e89f-4dc5-a799-ad1d358f329e","author":{"role":"assistant","name":null,"metadata":{}},"create_time":1786890286.379134,"update_time":null,"content":{"content_type":"text","parts":["# WORK-LAB 云端审计与 Observer 全量重构架构报告\n\n## 执行摘要\n\nWORK-LAB 的方向本身是对的：它不是普通 Dashboard，而是面向 Hermes、Codex、GitHub 等工作流的治理与只读观测控制面。云端审计基线采用 `main` 最新提交 `fadcded4c4db8d6e1543e078b67cb746f0159a1f`。当前最值得保留的是只读、LIVE/SNAPSHOT/OFFLINE、last-good 和 fail-closed 真实性边界；最需要重构的是 **Projection 数据模型、Execution/Trace 主实体、前端信息架构和统一视觉系统**。不建议继续在现有 Dashboard 上堆卡片，应升级为 **Execution-centric AI Workflow Observatory**。\n\n## 云端审计基线与证据清单\n\n**先说明证据边界。** 本轮确实通过连接的 GitHub 读取了 `DTALEX66/WORK-LAB` 云端仓库元数据、最新提交和该提交的 recursive tree；这与之前仅依据你上传的 Observer JS 文件分析不同。仓库为公开仓库，默认分支是 `main`，仓库描述将其定义为 Hermes / Codex / GitHub / OpenHuman / Open Design 的个人工作流治理控制面。审计基线采用 GitHub 连接器返回的最新 `main` 提交：\n\n`fadcded4c4db8d6e1543e078b67cb746f0159a1f`\n\n提交信息为：\n\n> `[main] (WORK-LAB) 完成2026年8月工作流监控优化，补齐单测与文档 [变更范围: 工作流监控、API连接模式]`\n\n提交时间为 2026 年 8 月 16 日。该 SHA 的 recursive tree 也已成功读取。[WORK-LAB 仓库](https://github.com/DTALEX66/WORK-LAB) · [审计基线提交](https://github.com/DTALEX66/WORK-LAB/commit/fadcded4c4db8d6e1543e078b67cb746f0159a1f)\n\n值得特别注意的是，2026 年 8 月 15 日到 16 日连续出现多次 Observer frontend 重构提交，例如 `dfdb1557…`、`b5df1d1c…`、`9df8a33f…`、`fecd9f65…`、`2ce04ede…`，紧接着又有本次监控/API 优化提交。这说明 Observer 正处于非常密集的设计迭代期；从产品架构角度，此时最危险的是继续局部“改卡片、换样式”，而没有先冻结数据模型和信息架构。[WORK-LAB commits](https://github.com/DTALEX66/WORK-LAB/commits/main/)\n\n**重要审计完整性声明：** recursive tree 已取得，但本次证据集中只完整展开了树的前部和部分 blob 元数据；并没有逐一展开所有 blob 正文。因此，下面对**已云端验证**、**来自你上传版本验证**、**待逐 blob 复核**三种证据严格区分。未读取的内容不会伪装成“已审计”。这意味着本文可以作为重构架构基线和 TaskPack，但不能诚实地声称“每一个云端文件正文都已经逐行读过”。\n\n当前已确认的云端文件级证据包括：\n\n| 范围 | 云端已确认对象 | Blob SHA / 状态 | 审计基线 |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| Repository | `DTALEX66/WORK-LAB` | public；default=`main` | `fadcded…` |\n| CI | `.github/workflows/work-lab-ci.yml` | `9239d4098485662b45c03dcbbd97a126bf3e45ca` | `fadcded…` |\n| Governance | `00-governance/AGENTS.md` | `8e32…` | `fadcded…` |\n| Governance | `00-governance/ACCESS-MATRIX.md` | `6d022…` | `fadcded…` |\n| Governance | `00-governance/CONTROL-PLANE-GOVERNANCE.md` | `f1ccd…` | `fadcded…` |\n| Governance | `00-governance/DEPLOYMENT-GOVERNANCE.md` | `f8336…` | `fadcded…` |\n| Governance | `00-governance/HERMES-HARNESS-GOVERNANCE.md` | `118de…` | `fadcded…` |\n| Governance | `00-governance/MEMORY-GOVERNANCE.md` | `d7838…` | `fadcded…` |\n| Governance | `00-governance/OPENCODE-CC-SWITCH-POSTCHECK.md` | `cdb688…` | `fadcded…` |\n| Governance | `00-governance/PINNED-DEPENDENCIES.md` | `8afccd…` | `fadcded…` |\n| Governance | `00-governance/README.md` | `196123…` | `fadcded…` |\n| Governance | `00-governance/RULE-VERSION-REGISTRY.md` | `830432…` | `fadcded…` |\n| Governance | `00-governance/TRUST.md` | `548e10…` | `fadcded…` |\n| Governance | `00-governance/WORKFLOW-IMPROVEMENT-PROTOCOL.md` | `a9bb…` | `fadcded…` |\n| Governance | `00-governance/policies/WORKFLOW-POLICY.json` | `5598f…` | `fadcded…` |\n| Governance | `00-governance/registries/PUBLISH-RULES.yaml` | `22c06…` | `fadcded…` |\n| Governance | `00-governance/registries/memory-registry.yaml` | `25664…` | `fadcded…` |\n| Flags | `00-governance/flags/auto-mode.json` 等 | recursive tree 已确认目录 | `fadcded…` |\n| Workflow | `10-workflow/**` | tree 后半部分正文未完整展开 | `fadcded…` |\n| Observer | `30-observer/**` | 云端正文未在本轮全部展开；已有用户上传版本可交叉审计 | `fadcded…` |\n| Knowledge | `40-knowledge/**` | 未逐 blob 展开 | `fadcded…` |\n| Taskpacks | `50-taskpacks/**` | 未逐 blob 展开 | `fadcded…` |\n| `package.json` | 需逐树确认所在模块和内容 | **未核验，不能猜** | `fadcded…` |\n| lockfile | 需逐树确认具体类型 | **未核验，不能猜** | `fadcded…` |\n| build scripts | 需逐 blob 展开 | **未核验** | `fadcded…` |\n| tests | Observer/Workflow 测试正文 | **未完成逐文件正文审计** | `fadcded…` |\n\n[CI 文件 @ baseline](https://github.com/DTALEX66/WORK-LAB/blob/fadcded4c4db8d6e1543e078b67cb746f0159a1f/.github/workflows/work-lab-ci.yml) · [Governance @ baseline](https://github.com/DTALEX66/WORK-LAB/tree/fadcded4c4db8d6e1543e078b67cb746f0159a1f/00-governance)\n\n你上传的 Observer 代码仍有很高价值，因为它可以直接说明当前前端设计思想。例如 `api.js` 明确区分 SNAPSHOT / FIXTURE / LIVE，并规定前端不写服务器；LIVE 只从经过约束的本地接口读取。fileciteturn0file7L1-L10 `state.js` 已实现 last-good 保留策略：刷新失败时不把有效观测清空，而是进入 stale/offline。fileciteturn0file5L68-L97\n\n`render-v3.js` 甚至已经把“不得把未采集数据包装成实时数据、null/UNKNOWN 不应变成装饰性 KPI”作为生产原则。fileciteturn0file4L3-L8 这说明 WORK-LAB 的**真实性哲学没有错**；现在真正的问题，是这套哲学没有被提升成完整的数据契约和产品信息架构。\n\n当前客户端可信状态机应保留为：\n\n```mermaid\nstateDiagram-v2\n    [*] --> SNAPSHOT\n    SNAPSHOT --> LIVE: backend transport verified\n    LIVE --> LIVE: revision increases / SSE healthy\n    LIVE --> STALE: refresh or stream failure\n    STALE --> LIVE: valid newer projection received\n    STALE --> OFFLINE: source unavailable beyond policy\n    OFFLINE --> LIVE: source recovers and validates\n\n    note right of LIVE\n      不能由 UI 自己猜测\n      必须来自经过验证的后端 transport\n    end note\n\n    note right of STALE\n      展示 last-good\n      但必须明确 stale\n    end note\n\n    note right of OFFLINE\n      不自动拿 fixture 冒充 production\n    end note\n```\n\n上传版本中 `app.js` 已明确在 LIVE 获取失败后进入 OFFLINE/UNKNOWN，而不是偷偷 fallback 到 bundled snapshot/fixture。fileciteturn0file8L271-L307 `api.js` 对 LIVE 还有 event stream、coverage、heartbeat、writer watermark、loopback event URL 等验证条件。fileciteturn0file7L271-L287\n\n这部分应该成为新架构的 **Frozen Truth Boundary**。\n\n## 架构、数据流与问题分级\n\n现在最核心的产品架构判断是：\n\n> **不要把 WORK-LAB Observer 继续设计成“项目指标 Dashboard”；应把它升级为“以 Execution 为主实体的 AI Workflow Observatory”。**\n\n目前用户看到“不好看、没质感、数据不准、布局不对”，这些症状并非互相独立。它们实际上来自同一个根因：\n\n```text\n没有确定最重要的产品实体\n        ↓\nProjection 按页面需要堆字段\n        ↓\nRenderer 自己解释字段\n        ↓\n多个项目/状态视图重复\n        ↓\nDashboard 变成卡片集合\n        ↓\n视觉设计只能不断装修\n        ↓\n数据语义越来越难判断\n```\n\n上传的 `fusion-v3.js` 已能看到这个症状：Project Overview、Runtime Matrix、Project Health 三块都在重复描述项目状态，只是组织方式不同。fileciteturn0file2L59-L98\n\n而 `app.js` 已把 v3 完整界面主要交给 `WlFusionV3.render(d)`。fileciteturn0file8L82-L103 因此一个大型 composition renderer 同时承担信息架构、状态解释和最终页面拼装，很容易造成“每次设计迭代继续往一个文件里加东西”的局面。\n\n**当前可验证架构与建议重构边界：**\n\n```mermaid\nflowchart LR\n    subgraph Sources[\"Workflow / Source Plane\"]\n        W[\"Workflow Assistance\"]\n        G[\"Git / GitHub\"]\n        C[\"CI / Validation\"]\n        A[\"Agent / Harness\"]\n        M[\"Model usage sources\"]\n    end\n\n    subgraph Collection[\"Observation Boundary\"]\n        CO[\"Collectors / Adapters\"]\n        SAN[\"Sanitization + Evidence Policy\"]\n    end\n\n    subgraph Backend[\"Observer Backend\"]\n        RT[\"Observer Runtime\"]\n        REC[\"Reconciliation / Normalization\"]\n        EX[\"Execution Graph Builder<br/>NEW\"]\n        TR[\"Trust Enricher<br/>NEW\"]\n        PR[\"Projection v3\"]\n    end\n\n    subgraph Contract[\"Read-only Contract\"]\n        S[\"Snapshot API\"]\n        E[\"Event/SSE\"]\n    end\n\n    subgraph Client[\"Tauri Frontend\"]\n        API[\"api.js<br/>Frozen truth boundary\"]\n        ST[\"state.js<br/>last-good / revision\"]\n        SEL[\"Selectors<br/>NEW\"]\n        UI[\"Command Center / Trace / Runtime / Trust\"]\n    end\n\n    W --> CO\n    G --> CO\n    C --> CO\n    A --> CO\n    M --> CO\n\n    CO --> SAN\n    SAN --> RT\n    RT --> REC\n    REC --> EX\n    EX --> TR\n    TR --> PR\n\n    PR --> S\n    PR --> E\n\n    S --> API\n    E --> API\n    API --> ST\n    ST --> SEL\n    SEL --> UI\n\n    classDef trust fill:#162334,stroke:#6ba7ff,color:#fff\n    class SAN,TR,API,ST trust\n```\n\n其中 Collector/Sanitization/Runtime 的云端具体实现正文需要逐 blob 复核，因此上图对这些节点表达的是**目标职责边界**；客户端 LIVE/state 语义则有上传源码直接佐证。fileciteturn0file7L1-L10 fileciteturn0file5L68-L97\n\n**问题分级采用三类证据：V=代码验证；I=架构推断；U=尚待云端正文核验。**\n\n| 优先级 | 问题 | 证据 | 影响 | 风险 | 重构动作 |\n|---|---|---|---|---|---|\n| **P0** | 数值缺少统一的 provenance / semantics 契约，就无法系统判断“准确”还是“估算” | V：renderer 已主动保护 null/UNKNOWN；说明此问题已经被意识到，但仍主要靠展示层纪律。fileciteturn0file4L3-L8 | Token、cost、CI、activity 容易被用户理解成同等可信度 | Critical | 每个 measurement 必须携带 `source/observedAt/freshness/semantics/coverage` |\n| **P0** | LIVE/STALE/OFFLINE 是安全与真实性边界，不是视觉状态 | V：`api.js` 和 `state.js`。fileciteturn0file7L271-L287 fileciteturn0file5L68-L97 | UI 重构若破坏会直接造成假实时数据 | Critical | 冻结 `api.js/state.js` 行为；添加 contract tests |\n| **P0** | 当前产品主实体不够明确；Project 被用来承载过多运行语义 | I，结合重复 Project surfaces；需 schema blob 最终确认 | 无法正确表达多 Agent、多 model、多 step、多项目一次执行 | Critical | 引入 `Execution`、`Event`、`Evidence` 一等实体 |\n| **P0** | “数据不准”必须在 projection 层解决，不能靠 UI 纠正 | V/I：现有 renderer 已在努力避免假值。fileciteturn0file4L3-L8 | 前端二次推导会制造不同页面不同答案 | High | 所有业务 KPI 后端投影；前端仅 select / format |\n| **P1** | Project Overview / Runtime Matrix / Project Health 信息重叠 | V：`fusion-v3.js`。fileciteturn0file2L59-L98 | 首屏认知负荷高；空间浪费；视觉无主次 | High | 合并为 Project Workspace + Delivery table |\n| **P1** | `fusion-v3.js` 作为大型页面 Composer，职责过宽 | V：`app.js` v3 routing。fileciteturn0file8L82-L103 | 每次功能增加都侵蚀维护性 | High | 拆 view/component/selectors，不再一文件拼全页 |\n| **P1** | 当前 Dashboard 缺少 Execution Timeline/Trace 作为主交互 | I，且是用户体验反馈的核心 | 看得到状态，却看不懂“发生了什么” | High | Trace Viewer 成为第二核心界面 |\n| **P1** | Data Trust 目前应该从辅助信息升级为正式产品模块 | V：已有 LIVE/coverage/last-good 语义。fileciteturn0file7L271-L287 | 用户无法判断数据为何可信 | High | Trust Center + per-value provenance |\n| **P1** | 当前 Native SVG chart 思路正确，但 chart 不能承担数据语义 | V：`charts.js` 已坚持 native SVG、无 chart runtime dependency。fileciteturn0file0L1-L4 | 继续堆图表会回到 Grafana 式“图表墙” | Medium | 保留 chart engine，只用于真正时间序列 |\n| **P1** | UI 重构存在 accessibility 回归风险 | V：已有 live region、键盘导航、focus 管理。fileciteturn0file6L20-L41 | 新 UI 若推倒重写可能比现版更差 | High | WCAG 2.2 AA 作为硬 Gate，而非收尾检查 |\n| **P2** | CSS/design-token 是否已经全面统一 | U | 容易产生局部 style patch 和无质感 | Medium | 统一 `tokens.css`，禁止组件 hard-code 状态色 |\n| **P2** | 当前 CI 是否覆盖 schema compatibility / a11y / visual regression | U；只确认 `.github/workflows/work-lab-ci.yml` 存在 | UI 快速迭代无法阻止视觉/真实性回归 | Medium | 将 truth、schema、Playwright、axe/Tauri smoke 加入 CI |\n| **P2** | `package.json` / lockfile / frontend build 链 | U | 无法决定是否立即迁移 TypeScript/Vite | Medium | 先审计 build 链，再决定工具迁移，不为了重构强上框架 |\n\n**新的准确性原则必须写进 schema，而不是靠开发者记住：**\n\n```text\nnull ≠ 0\nunknown ≠ healthy\nstale ≠ live\nestimated ≠ observed\nderived ≠ source value\nmissing ≠ empty\nno event ≠ idle\nno token collector ≠ zero token usage\nCI unknown ≠ CI passed\ndirty unknown ≠ clean\n```\n\n任何需要展示的值都应该能够回答：\n\n```text\n这个值来自哪里？\n什么时间发生？\n什么时间被采集？\n什么时间进入 Projection？\n它是 observed、derived 还是 estimated？\n当前 coverage 是多少？\n它已经 stale 了吗？\n能否追溯到 source event/evidence？\n```\n\n这会比再换一次配色，对“数据不准”的改善大得多。\n\n## 对标研究与目标产品架构\n\n开源项目应该拆**架构能力**，而不是把八个项目的视觉语言拼在一起。WORK-LAB 最终不应长得像 SigNoz，也不应像 Homepage；它应该借这些产品的成熟模式，形成自己的产品系统。\n\n| 项目 | Trace / Execution | Dashboard-as-code | Schema-driven UI | AI Observability | Timeline / Trace | Topology / Map | Visualization Engine | WORK-LAB 应吸收 |\n|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|\n| **SigNoz** | 强，OTel Trace/Span | 中 | 中 | 强 | 强 | 强 | 强 | Trace 数据组织、service/dependency 思维 |\n| **Langfuse** | **非常强，LLM Trace/Observation 是核心** | 弱/中 | 中 | **非常强** | **非常强** | 弱 | 中 | Execution → observation → model/tool step |\n| **HyperDX** | 强 | 中 | 中 | 间接 | **强** | 中 | 强 | Logs/trace/event 的时间相关体验 |\n| **Perses** | 数据源驱动 | **非常强** | **非常强** | 非核心 | 数据源驱动 | 插件/数据源驱动 | 强 | 开放 dashboard resource / plugin model |\n| **Grafana** | Tempo 等提供 | **非常强** | 强 | 依赖数据源/插件 | 强 | Node Graph / service graph | **非常强** | Panel/query/variable/viz engine 思想 |\n| **Homepage** | 无 | YAML 配置型 | 中 | 无 | 无 | 无 | 弱 | 极简首页、服务状态信息密度 |\n| **Homarr** | 无 | 中 | 中 | 无 | 无 | 无 | 中 | 可组合 Home/Command surface |\n| **Beszel** | 无 | 弱 | 中 | 无 | 弱 | 弱 | 中 | 轻量、克制的 machine monitoring 视觉 |\n\n官方资料： [SigNoz Docs](https://signoz.io/docs/) · [SigNoz GitHub](https://github.com/SigNoz/signoz)；[Langfuse Docs](https://langfuse.com/docs) · [Langfuse GitHub](https://github.com/langfuse/langfuse)；[HyperDX GitHub](https://github.com/hyperdxio/hyperdx)；[Perses](https://perses.dev/) · [Perses GitHub](https://github.com/perses/perses)；[Grafana Dashboards](https://grafana.com/docs/grafana/latest/dashboards/) · [Grafana GitHub](https://github.com/grafana/grafana)；[Homepage Docs](https://gethomepage.dev/) · [Homepage GitHub](https://github.com/gethomepage/homepage)；[Homarr](https://homarr.dev/) · [Homarr GitHub](https://github.com/homarr-labs/homarr)；[Beszel GitHub](https://github.com/henrygd/beszel)。\n\n具体代码复用上，应该非常克制。比较稳妥的研究入口是 Grafana 的 `public/app/features/dashboard/` 与 `packages/grafana-ui/`；Langfuse 的 web/shared package；HyperDX 的 app/API package；Perses 的 UI 与 model/API definitions。其余项目的具体目录结构可能随版本移动，实施时必须先锁定目标 commit，再检查许可证与文件路径；**这里不建议直接复制任何组件代码**。架构思想复用比代码复制更适合 WORK-LAB。\n\n我建议最终产品不是“八个 Dashboard 的合集”，而是：\n\n```mermaid\nflowchart TB\n    U[\"Human / Intent\"]\n    W[\"WORK-LAB Workflow\"]\n\n    subgraph O[\"WORK-LAB Observer\"]\n        EX[\"Execution Graph\"]\n        PX[\"Project Context\"]\n        AR[\"Agent Runtime\"]\n        MR[\"Model Runtime\"]\n        DL[\"Delivery / CI\"]\n        EV[\"Evidence\"]\n        TR[\"Trust / Data Quality\"]\n    end\n\n    U --> W\n    W --> EX\n    EX --> PX\n    EX --> AR\n    AR --> MR\n    EX --> DL\n    EX --> EV\n    PX --> TR\n    AR --> TR\n    MR --> TR\n    DL --> TR\n    EV --> TR\n```\n\n产品首页回答的不是“有多少指标”，而是六个问题：\n\n| 用户问题 | 对应产品模块 |\n|---|---|\n| 整体现在正常吗？ | Command Center |\n| 哪些项目正在被修改？ | Project Workspace |\n| AI / Harness 正在执行什么？ | Execution Timeline |\n| 哪个 Agent / Model / Tool 被使用？ | AI Runtime |\n| Git / CI / Artifact 是否可靠？ | Delivery |\n| 我看到的这些数据可靠吗？ | Trust Center |\n\n这也是为什么我不建议继续把 `Project Overview + Runtime Matrix + Project Health + Token Cards + Governance Cards` 平铺在首页。\n\n## 新数据模型与迁移策略\n\n目标不是废掉现有 Snapshot，而是给它一个更正确的领域模型：\n\n```text\nProjection v2\nproject-centric\n        ↓ compatibility adapter\nProjection v3\nexecution-centric\n        ↓\nsame read-only API / SSE truth boundary\n        ↓\nnew frontend\n```\n\n关键实体关系：\n\n```mermaid\nerDiagram\n    PROJECT ||--o{ EXECUTION : contains\n    AGENT ||--o{ EXECUTION : performs\n    EXECUTION ||--o{ EVENT : emits\n    EXECUTION }o--o{ MODEL : invokes\n    EXECUTION }o--o{ TOOL : invokes\n    EXECUTION ||--o{ EVIDENCE : proves\n    EXECUTION ||--o{ ARTIFACT : produces\n    PROJECT ||--o{ ARTIFACT : owns\n    PROJECT ||--o{ TELEMETRY : observes\n    EXECUTION ||--o{ TELEMETRY : observes\n    GOVERNANCE ||--o{ EVIDENCE : evaluates\n```\n\n以下就是建议新增的完整文件正文，可保存为：\n\n`30-observer/work-lab-observer/schemas/execution-projection.schema.json`\n\n```json\n{\n  \"$schema\": \"https://json-schema.org/draft/2020-12/schema\",\n  \"$id\": \"https://work-lab.local/schemas/execution-projection.schema.json\",\n  \"title\": \"WORK-LAB Observer Execution Projection\",\n  \"description\": \"Read-only execution-centric projection for WORK-LAB Observer.\",\n  \"type\": \"object\",\n  \"additionalProperties\": false,\n  \"required\": [\n    \"schemaVersion\",\n    \"projectionRevision\",\n    \"generatedAt\",\n    \"transport\",\n    \"trust\",\n    \"projects\",\n    \"executions\",\n    \"agents\",\n    \"models\",\n    \"tools\",\n    \"events\",\n    \"evidence\",\n    \"artifacts\",\n    \"governance\",\n    \"telemetry\"\n  ],\n  \"properties\": {\n    \"schemaVersion\": {\n      \"type\": \"string\",\n      \"const\": \"3.0\"\n    },\n    \"projectionRevision\": {\n      \"type\": \"integer\",\n      \"minimum\": 0\n    },\n    \"generatedAt\": {\n      \"type\": \"string\",\n      \"format\": \"date-time\"\n    },\n    \"transport\": {\n      \"type\": \"string\",\n      \"enum\": [\"LIVE\", \"SNAPSHOT\", \"OFFLINE\"]\n    },\n    \"trust\": {\n      \"$ref\": \"#/$defs/trust\"\n    },\n    \"projects\": {\n      \"type\": \"array\",\n      \"items\": { \"$ref\": \"#/$defs/project\" }\n    },\n    \"executions\": {\n      \"type\": \"array\",\n      \"items\": { \"$ref\": \"#/$defs/execution\" }\n    },\n    \"agents\": {\n      \"type\": \"array\",\n      \"items\": { \"$ref\": \"#/$defs/agent\" }\n    },\n    \"models\": {\n      \"type\": \"array\",\n      \"items\": { \"$ref\": \"#/$defs/model\" }\n    },\n    \"tools\": {\n      \"type\": \"array\",\n      \"items\": { \"$ref\": \"#/$defs/tool\" }\n    },\n    \"events\": {\n      \"type\": \"array\",\n      \"items\": { \"$ref\": \"#/$defs/event\" }\n    },\n    \"evidence\": {\n      \"type\": \"array\",\n      \"items\": { \"$ref\": \"#/$defs/evidence\" }\n    },\n    \"artifacts\": {\n      \"type\": \"array\",\n      \"items\": { \"$ref\": \"#/$defs/artifact\" }\n    },\n    \"governance\": {\n      \"$ref\": \"#/$defs/governance\"\n    },\n    \"telemetry\": {\n      \"type\": \"array\",\n      \"items\": { \"$ref\": \"#/$defs/measurement\" }\n    },\n    \"legacy\": {\n      \"description\": \"Temporary v2 compatibility payload. Remove after migration.\",\n      \"type\": [\"object\", \"null\"],\n      \"additionalProperties\": true\n    }\n  },\n  \"$defs\": {\n    \"trust\": {\n      \"type\": \"object\",\n      \"additionalProperties\": false,\n      \"required\": [\n        \"source\",\n        \"lastSeen\",\n        \"freshnessMs\",\n        \"coverage\",\n        \"semantics\"\n      ],\n      \"properties\": {\n        \"source\": {\n          \"type\": \"string\",\n          \"minLength\": 1\n        },\n        \"sourceRevision\": {\n          \"type\": [\"string\", \"integer\", \"null\"]\n        },\n        \"lastSeen\": {\n          \"type\": [\"string\", \"null\"],\n          \"format\": \"date-time\"\n        },\n        \"freshnessMs\": {\n          \"type\": [\"integer\", \"null\"],\n          \"minimum\": 0\n        },\n        \"coverage\": {\n          \"type\": [\"number\", \"null\"],\n          \"minimum\": 0,\n          \"maximum\": 1\n        },\n        \"semantics\": {\n          \"type\": \"string\",\n          \"enum\": [\n            \"observed\",\n            \"derived\",\n            \"estimated\",\n            \"unknown\"\n          ]\n        },\n        \"qualityFlags\": {\n          \"type\": \"array\",\n          \"items\": {\n            \"type\": \"string\",\n            \"enum\": [\n              \"stale\",\n              \"partial\",\n              \"duplicate\",\n              \"dropped\",\n              \"malformed\",\n              \"conflict\",\n              \"source-unavailable\"\n            ]\n          },\n          \"uniqueItems\": true\n        }\n      }\n    },\n\n    \"project\": {\n      \"type\": \"object\",\n      \"additionalProperties\": false,\n      \"required\": [\"id\", \"name\", \"state\", \"trust\"],\n      \"properties\": {\n        \"id\": { \"type\": \"string\", \"minLength\": 1 },\n        \"name\": { \"type\": \"string\", \"minLength\": 1 },\n        \"description\": { \"type\": [\"string\", \"null\"] },\n        \"state\": {\n          \"type\": \"string\",\n          \"enum\": [\n            \"active\",\n            \"idle\",\n            \"blocked\",\n            \"degraded\",\n            \"unknown\"\n          ]\n        },\n        \"repository\": { \"type\": [\"string\", \"null\"] },\n        \"branch\": { \"type\": [\"string\", \"null\"] },\n        \"headSha\": { \"type\": [\"string\", \"null\"] },\n        \"dirty\": { \"type\": [\"boolean\", \"null\"] },\n        \"activeExecutionIds\": {\n          \"type\": \"array\",\n          \"items\": { \"type\": \"string\" },\n          \"uniqueItems\": true\n        },\n        \"agentIds\": {\n          \"type\": \"array\",\n          \"items\": { \"type\": \"string\" },\n          \"uniqueItems\": true\n        },\n        \"trust\": { \"$ref\": \"#/$defs/trust\" }\n      }\n    },\n\n    \"execution\": {\n      \"type\": \"object\",\n      \"additionalProperties\": false,\n      \"required\": [\n        \"id\",\n        \"traceId\",\n        \"projectId\",\n        \"status\",\n        \"startedAt\",\n        \"trust\"\n      ],\n      \"properties\": {\n        \"id\": { \"type\": \"string\", \"minLength\": 1 },\n        \"traceId\": { \"type\": \"string\", \"minLength\": 1 },\n        \"parentExecutionId\": { \"type\": [\"string\", \"null\"] },\n        \"projectId\": { \"type\": \"string\", \"minLength\": 1 },\n        \"agentId\": { \"type\": [\"string\", \"null\"] },\n        \"status\": {\n          \"type\": \"string\",\n          \"enum\": [\n            \"queued\",\n            \"running\",\n            \"waiting\",\n            \"succeeded\",\n            \"failed\",\n            \"cancelled\",\n            \"blocked\",\n            \"unknown\"\n          ]\n        },\n        \"startedAt\": {\n          \"type\": \"string\",\n          \"format\": \"date-time\"\n        },\n        \"endedAt\": {\n          \"type\": [\"string\", \"null\"],\n          \"format\": \"date-time\"\n        },\n        \"modelIds\": {\n          \"type\": \"array\",\n          \"items\": { \"type\": \"string\" },\n          \"uniqueItems\": true\n        },\n        \"toolIds\": {\n          \"type\": \"array\",\n          \"items\": { \"type\": \"string\" },\n          \"uniqueItems\": true\n        },\n        \"eventIds\": {\n          \"type\": \"array\",\n          \"items\": { \"type\": \"string\" },\n          \"uniqueItems\": true\n        },\n        \"evidenceIds\": {\n          \"type\": \"array\",\n          \"items\": { \"type\": \"string\" },\n          \"uniqueItems\": true\n        },\n        \"artifactIds\": {\n          \"type\": \"array\",\n          \"items\": { \"type\": \"string\" },\n          \"uniqueItems\": true\n        },\n        \"summary\": {\n          \"description\": \"Sanitized operational summary only; never raw prompt/response.\",\n          \"type\": [\"string\", \"null\"]\n        },\n        \"trust\": { \"$ref\": \"#/$defs/trust\" }\n      }\n    },\n\n    \"agent\": {\n      \"type\": \"object\",\n      \"additionalProperties\": false,\n      \"required\": [\"id\", \"name\", \"kind\", \"status\", \"trust\"],\n      \"properties\": {\n        \"id\": { \"type\": \"string\" },\n        \"name\": { \"type\": \"string\" },\n        \"kind\": {\n          \"type\": \"string\",\n          \"enum\": [\n            \"orchestrator\",\n            \"coding-agent\",\n            \"harness\",\n            \"assistant\",\n            \"other\"\n          ]\n        },\n        \"provider\": { \"type\": [\"string\", \"null\"] },\n        \"status\": {\n          \"type\": \"string\",\n          \"enum\": [\n            \"active\",\n            \"idle\",\n            \"waiting\",\n            \"unavailable\",\n            \"unknown\"\n          ]\n        },\n        \"trust\": { \"$ref\": \"#/$defs/trust\" }\n      }\n    },\n\n    \"model\": {\n      \"type\": \"object\",\n      \"additionalProperties\": false,\n      \"required\": [\"id\", \"provider\", \"name\", \"trust\"],\n      \"properties\": {\n        \"id\": { \"type\": \"string\" },\n        \"provider\": { \"type\": \"string\" },\n        \"name\": { \"type\": \"string\" },\n        \"deployment\": { \"type\": [\"string\", \"null\"] },\n        \"trust\": { \"$ref\": \"#/$defs/trust\" }\n      }\n    },\n\n    \"tool\": {\n      \"type\": \"object\",\n      \"additionalProperties\": false,\n      \"required\": [\"id\", \"name\", \"type\", \"trust\"],\n      \"properties\": {\n        \"id\": { \"type\": \"string\" },\n        \"name\": { \"type\": \"string\" },\n        \"type\": {\n          \"type\": \"string\",\n          \"enum\": [\n            \"git\",\n            \"github\",\n            \"shell\",\n            \"filesystem\",\n            \"ci\",\n            \"browser\",\n            \"plugin\",\n            \"other\"\n          ]\n        },\n        \"status\": {\n          \"type\": [\"string\", \"null\"],\n          \"enum\": [\n            \"ok\",\n            \"degraded\",\n            \"failed\",\n            \"unknown\",\n            null\n          ]\n        },\n        \"trust\": { \"$ref\": \"#/$defs/trust\" }\n      }\n    },\n\n    \"event\": {\n      \"type\": \"object\",\n      \"additionalProperties\": false,\n      \"required\": [\n        \"id\",\n        \"executionId\",\n        \"type\",\n        \"occurredAt\",\n        \"trust\"\n      ],\n      \"properties\": {\n        \"id\": { \"type\": \"string\" },\n        \"executionId\": { \"type\": \"string\" },\n        \"type\": { \"type\": \"string\" },\n        \"occurredAt\": {\n          \"type\": \"string\",\n          \"format\": \"date-time\"\n        },\n        \"ingestedAt\": {\n          \"type\": [\"string\", \"null\"],\n          \"format\": \"date-time\"\n        },\n        \"severity\": {\n          \"type\": \"string\",\n          \"enum\": [\"info\", \"warning\", \"error\", \"critical\"]\n        },\n        \"label\": { \"type\": [\"string\", \"null\"] },\n        \"sanitizedPayload\": {\n          \"type\": [\"object\", \"null\"],\n          \"additionalProperties\": true\n        },\n        \"trust\": { \"$ref\": \"#/$defs/trust\" }\n      }\n    },\n\n    \"evidence\": {\n      \"type\": \"object\",\n      \"additionalProperties\": false,\n      \"required\": [\"id\", \"kind\", \"status\", \"trust\"],\n      \"properties\": {\n        \"id\": { \"type\": \"string\" },\n        \"executionId\": { \"type\": [\"string\", \"null\"] },\n        \"kind\": {\n          \"type\": \"string\",\n          \"enum\": [\n            \"test\",\n            \"ci\",\n            \"git\",\n            \"artifact\",\n            \"governance\",\n            \"validation\",\n            \"other\"\n          ]\n        },\n        \"status\": {\n          \"type\": \"string\",\n          \"enum\": [\n            \"pass\",\n            \"fail\",\n            \"partial\",\n            \"unavailable\",\n            \"unknown\"\n          ]\n        },\n        \"producedAt\": {\n          \"type\": [\"string\", \"null\"],\n          \"format\": \"date-time\"\n        },\n        \"uri\": { \"type\": [\"string\", \"null\"] },\n        \"digest\": { \"type\": [\"string\", \"null\"] },\n        \"trust\": { \"$ref\": \"#/$defs/trust\" }\n      }\n    },\n\n    \"artifact\": {\n      \"type\": \"object\",\n      \"additionalProperties\": false,\n      \"required\": [\"id\", \"kind\", \"trust\"],\n      \"properties\": {\n        \"id\": { \"type\": \"string\" },\n        \"executionId\": { \"type\": [\"string\", \"null\"] },\n        \"projectId\": { \"type\": [\"string\", \"null\"] },\n        \"kind\": { \"type\": \"string\" },\n        \"path\": { \"type\": [\"string\", \"null\"] },\n        \"digest\": { \"type\": [\"string\", \"null\"] },\n        \"createdAt\": {\n          \"type\": [\"string\", \"null\"],\n          \"format\": \"date-time\"\n        },\n        \"trust\": { \"$ref\": \"#/$defs/trust\" }\n      }\n    },\n\n    \"governance\": {\n      \"type\": \"object\",\n      \"additionalProperties\": false,\n      \"required\": [\"rules\", \"trust\"],\n      \"properties\": {\n        \"rules\": {\n          \"type\": \"array\",\n          \"items\": {\n            \"type\": \"object\",\n            \"additionalProperties\": false,\n            \"required\": [\"id\", \"status\"],\n            \"properties\": {\n              \"id\": { \"type\": \"string\" },\n              \"label\": { \"type\": [\"string\", \"null\"] },\n              \"status\": {\n                \"type\": \"string\",\n                \"enum\": [\n                  \"pass\",\n                  \"warning\",\n                  \"fail\",\n                  \"unknown\"\n                ]\n              },\n              \"evidenceIds\": {\n                \"type\": \"array\",\n                \"items\": { \"type\": \"string\" }\n              }\n            }\n          }\n        },\n        \"trust\": { \"$ref\": \"#/$defs/trust\" }\n      }\n    },\n\n    \"measurement\": {\n      \"type\": \"object\",\n      \"additionalProperties\": false,\n      \"required\": [\n        \"id\",\n        \"metric\",\n        \"value\",\n        \"unit\",\n        \"observedAt\",\n        \"trust\"\n      ],\n      \"properties\": {\n        \"id\": { \"type\": \"string\" },\n        \"projectId\": { \"type\": [\"string\", \"null\"] },\n        \"executionId\": { \"type\": [\"string\", \"null\"] },\n        \"agentId\": { \"type\": [\"string\", \"null\"] },\n        \"modelId\": { \"type\": [\"string\", \"null\"] },\n        \"metric\": {\n          \"type\": \"string\",\n          \"enum\": [\n            \"tokens.input\",\n            \"tokens.output\",\n            \"tokens.cache\",\n            \"cost\",\n            \"latency\",\n            \"duration\",\n            \"cache.hit_rate\",\n            \"events.count\",\n            \"executions.count\",\n            \"projection.lag\",\n            \"source.coverage\"\n          ]\n        },\n        \"value\": {\n          \"type\": [\"number\", \"null\"]\n        },\n        \"unit\": { \"type\": \"string\" },\n        \"observedAt\": {\n          \"type\": \"string\",\n          \"format\": \"date-time\"\n        },\n        \"pricingVersion\": {\n          \"description\": \"Required when cost is estimated from a pricing catalog.\",\n          \"type\": [\"string\", \"null\"]\n        },\n        \"trust\": { \"$ref\": \"#/$defs/trust\" }\n      }\n    }\n  }\n}\n```\n\n这里故意没有 raw prompt、raw response、credential、provider state 等内容。产品设计原则应是：\n\n> **Observer 看到运行事实，不需要看到私密语义内容。**\n\n**兼容迁移不要 big bang。** 推荐：\n\n```mermaid\nflowchart LR\n    OLD[\"Projection v2\"]\n    AD[\"v2 → v3 Adapter\"]\n    NEW[\"Projection v3\"]\n    DUAL[\"Dual validation\"]\n    UIOLD[\"Existing UI\"]\n    UINEW[\"Observer 3 UI\"]\n\n    OLD --> UIOLD\n    OLD --> AD\n    AD --> NEW\n    NEW --> DUAL\n    DUAL --> UINEW\n```\n\n迁移阶段先让 v2 和 v3 对同一 observation source 生成结果，比较不变量；新 UI 只在 v3 通过 truth gate 后切换。不要先删除 v2，也不要修改 `api.js/state.js` 的真实性行为。当前 state last-good 已经是值得保留的基础设施。fileciteturn0file5L68-L97\n\n## 前端全量重构与视觉系统\n\n这里我会比之前激进：**现有视觉应该全量重做，但不等于整个 runtime 全量推倒。**\n\n新前端建议采用：\n\n```text\nShell        curated\nNavigation   curated\nCore pages   curated\nTelemetry    schema-driven\nCharts       native SVG\nState        existing truth-aware store\n```\n\n也就是说，不要走两个极端：\n\n```text\n❌ 全部写死\n❌ 全部做成通用 Dashboard Builder\n```\n\n正确组合是：\n\n> **产品主界面固定设计 + 次级 telemetry panel schema-driven。**\n\n建议组件树：\n\n```text\nObserverApp\n├── AppShell\n│   ├── Sidebar\n│   ├── Topbar\n│   ├── GlobalTransportStatus\n│   └── RouteOutlet\n│\n├── CommandCenterView\n│   ├── SystemPulse\n│   ├── ActiveExecutions\n│   ├── ProjectRail\n│   ├── AttentionQueue\n│   └── TrustSummary\n│\n├── ProjectWorkspaceView\n│   ├── ProjectHeader\n│   ├── ExecutionList\n│   ├── GitState\n│   ├── DeliveryState\n│   └── EvidenceList\n│\n├── ExecutionTraceView\n│   ├── TraceHeader\n│   ├── SpanTimeline\n│   ├── EventInspector\n│   ├── ModelCalls\n│   ├── ToolCalls\n│   └── EvidenceDrawer\n│\n├── AIRuntimeView\n│   ├── AgentMatrix\n│   ├── ModelUsage\n│   ├── TokenTrend\n│   ├── LatencyTrend\n│   └── CostPanel\n│\n├── DeliveryView\n│   ├── RepositoryMatrix\n│   ├── CIGates\n│   └── Artifacts\n│\n├── TrustCenterView\n│   ├── SourceCoverage\n│   ├── Freshness\n│   ├── ProjectionLag\n│   ├── QualityFlags\n│   └── ProvenanceInspector\n│\n├── CompactView\n└── OfflineView\n```\n\n路由建议使用简单静态兼容路由，不需要为了这件事引进大型 SPA 框架：\n\n```text\n#/overview\n#/projects\n#/projects/:projectId\n#/executions\n#/executions/:executionId\n#/runtime\n#/delivery\n#/trust\n#/compact\n```\n\n**页面契约：**\n\n| 页面 | 首要问题 | 主要数据 | 核心交互 | Accessibility |\n|---|---|---|---|---|\n| Command Center | 现在发生什么？ | projects, executions, trust, latest events | 点击 execution / attention | landmark、status text、keyboard |\n| Project Workspace | 这个项目当前发生什么？ | project + executions + git + evidence | filter execution / inspect SHA | table semantics |\n| Trace Viewer | 一次执行怎么走到现在？ | execution/events/agent/model/tool/evidence | timeline zoom/filter/inspect | timeline list fallback |\n| AI Runtime | AI 使用情况怎样？ | agents/models/telemetry | model/agent/date filters | graph text summary |\n| Delivery | Git/CI/artifact 正常吗？ | project/evidence/artifacts | status filter | `<table>`/sort aria |\n| Trust Center | 这些数字可靠吗？ | trust/quality/provenance | inspect source | 状态不能只靠颜色 |\n| Compact | 常驻时最少需要什么？ | active/blocked/latest/trust | single-click expand | large target |\n| Offline | 失联时最后知道什么？ | last-good + timestamps | retry | assertive only for transitions |\n\n响应式建议：\n\n```text\n≥ 1440px   12-column desktop\n1180–1439  10-column compact desktop\n900–1179   collapsed sidebar, two-column\n720–899    one-column control surface\n< 720      Compact semantics, not squeezed desktop\n```\n\n当前 accessibility 模块已经有 live region、keyboard navigation、focus movement，不应该因为视觉重做而退化。fileciteturn0file6L20-L41 新页面以 [WCAG 2.2](https://www.w3.org/TR/WCAG22/) AA 作为 hard gate。\n\n**视觉定位：**\n\n不是 Cyberpunk，不是企业蓝后台，不是 Grafana clone，也不是 Homepage 卡片墙。\n\n建议关键词：\n\n```text\nQuiet confidence\nDeveloper-grade\nAI-native\nEvidence-first\nDense but calm\nMonochrome-first\nStatus color only when semantic\n```\n\n设计 token 建议：\n\n```css\n:root {\n  /* Surface */\n  --wl-bg-canvas: #0b0e13;\n  --wl-bg-shell: #0e1218;\n  --wl-bg-surface: #12171f;\n  --wl-bg-surface-raised: #171d26;\n  --wl-bg-hover: #1b222d;\n\n  /* Border */\n  --wl-border-subtle: #202833;\n  --wl-border-default: #2a3441;\n  --wl-border-strong: #3b4858;\n\n  /* Text */\n  --wl-text-primary: #f1f4f8;\n  --wl-text-secondary: #aeb8c5;\n  --wl-text-muted: #768292;\n  --wl-text-code: #c6d3e3;\n\n  /* Brand / semantic */\n  --wl-accent: #78a9ff;\n  --wl-success: #62c995;\n  --wl-warning: #e3b55b;\n  --wl-danger: #e57373;\n  --wl-info: #7ba7e8;\n  --wl-unknown: #788391;\n\n  /* Transport */\n  --wl-live: #62c995;\n  --wl-stale: #e3b55b;\n  --wl-offline: #e57373;\n  --wl-snapshot: #7ba7e8;\n\n  /* Radius */\n  --wl-radius-sm: 6px;\n  --wl-radius-md: 10px;\n  --wl-radius-lg: 14px;\n\n  /* Spacing */\n  --wl-space-1: 4px;\n  --wl-space-2: 8px;\n  --wl-space-3: 12px;\n  --wl-space-4: 16px;\n  --wl-space-5: 20px;\n  --wl-space-6: 24px;\n  --wl-space-8: 32px;\n  --wl-space-10: 40px;\n\n  /* Typography */\n  --wl-font-ui: Inter, ui-sans-serif, system-ui, -apple-system, sans-serif;\n  --wl-font-mono: \"SFMono-Regular\", Consolas, \"Liberation Mono\", monospace;\n\n  /* Motion */\n  --wl-motion-fast: 120ms;\n  --wl-motion-normal: 160ms;\n  --wl-ease: cubic-bezier(.2,.8,.2,1);\n\n  /* Shadow: deliberately restrained */\n  --wl-shadow-raised:\n    0 1px 2px rgb(0 0 0 / 20%),\n    0 8px 24px rgb(0 0 0 / 12%);\n}\n\n[data-theme=\"light\"] {\n  --wl-bg-canvas: #f5f7fa;\n  --wl-bg-shell: #ffffff;\n  --wl-bg-surface: #ffffff;\n  --wl-bg-surface-raised: #f9fafc;\n  --wl-bg-hover: #f1f4f7;\n\n  --wl-border-subtle: #e7ebf0;\n  --wl-border-default: #d8dee7;\n  --wl-border-strong: #bcc6d2;\n\n  --wl-text-primary: #17202b;\n  --wl-text-secondary: #536171;\n  --wl-text-muted: #7d8997;\n  --wl-text-code: #34445a;\n}\n```\n\nTypography：\n\n| 层级 | 建议 |\n|---|---|\n| Command KPI | 30–34px / 600 |\n| Page title | 22–24px / 600 |\n| Section title | 16–18px / 600 |\n| Card title | 14–15px / 600 |\n| Body | 13–14px / 400 |\n| Metadata | 11–12px / 450 |\n| SHA / branch / trace ID | mono 11–13px |\n\nCard 只有在“对象本身值得成为容器”时存在。Project、Execution、Attention、Telemetry group、Trust group 可以成为 Card；**一个数字不能因为是数字就变成 Card**。\n\nChart 保留当前 native SVG 路线。`charts.js` 已经明确采用 native SVG 且避免运行时 chart library。fileciteturn0file0L1-L4 新版本只增加 crosshair、hover point、semantic markers、empty state、accessible text summary，不需要先引入 ECharts/Chart.js。\n\n下面是五套 `1920×1080` SVG 方向稿。它们是**产品布局/视觉结构定义**，不是最终像素级品牌稿，但可以直接保存成 `.svg` 作为 Harness 的第一轮 visual target。\n\n**Command Center — Dark**\n\n<svg viewBox=\"0 0 1920 1080\" width=\"100%\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"WORK-LAB Command Center dark concept\">\n<rect width=\"1920\" height=\"1080\" fill=\"#0b0e13\"/>\n<rect x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"248\" height=\"1080\" fill=\"#0e1218\"/>\n<text x=\"34\" y=\"54\" fill=\"#f1f4f8\" font-size=\"24\" font-family=\"sans-serif\" font-weight=\"600\">WORK-LAB</text>\n<text x=\"34\" y=\"82\" fill=\"#768292\" font-size=\"12\" font-family=\"sans-serif\">OBSERVER</text>\n<text x=\"34\" y=\"160\" fill=\"#f1f4f8\" font-size=\"14\" font-family=\"sans-serif\">Overview</text>\n<text x=\"34\" y=\"204\" fill=\"#768292\" font-size=\"14\" font-family=\"sans-serif\">Projects</text>\n<text x=\"34\" y=\"248\" fill=\"#768292\" font-size=\"14\" font-family=\"sans-serif\">Executions</text>\n<text x=\"34\" y=\"292\" fill=\"#768292\" font-size=\"14\" font-family=\"sans-serif\">AI Runtime</text>\n<text x=\"34\" y=\"336\" fill=\"#768292\" font-size=\"14\" font-family=\"sans-serif\">Delivery</text>\n<text x=\"34\" y=\"380\" fill=\"#768292\" font-size=\"14\" font-family=\"sans-serif\">Trust</text>\n<text x=\"284\" y=\"60\" fill=\"#f1f4f8\" font-size=\"26\" font-family=\"sans-serif\" font-weight=\"600\">Command Center</text>\n<text x=\"284\" y=\"88\" fill=\"#768292\" font-size=\"13\" font-family=\"sans-serif\">What is happening across WORK-LAB right now?</text>\n<rect x=\"1635\" y=\"32\" width=\"94\" height=\"34\" rx=\"17\" fill=\"#152820\" stroke=\"#315744\"/>\n<circle cx=\"1656\" cy=\"49\" r=\"5\" fill=\"#62c995\"/>\n<text x=\"1670\" y=\"54\" fill=\"#92d9b4\" font-size=\"12\" font-family=\"sans-serif\">LIVE</text>\n<rect x=\"1740\" y=\"32\" width=\"132\" height=\"34\" rx=\"17\" fill=\"#12171f\" stroke=\"#2a3441\"/>\n<text x=\"1761\" y=\"54\" fill=\"#aeb8c5\" font-size=\"12\" font-family=\"sans-serif\">READ ONLY</text>\n\n<rect x=\"284\" y=\"126\" width=\"1588\" height=\"118\" rx=\"14\" fill=\"#12171f\" stroke=\"#202833\"/>\n<text x=\"314\" y=\"159\" fill=\"#768292\" font-size=\"11\" font-family=\"sans-serif\">SYSTEM PULSE</text>\n<text x=\"314\" y=\"210\" fill=\"#f1f4f8\" font-size=\"34\" font-family=\"sans-serif\" font-weight=\"600\">All critical paths healthy</text>\n<text x=\"1110\" y=\"166\" fill=\"#768292\" font-size=\"11\">ACTIVE EXECUTIONS</text>\n<text x=\"1110\" y=\"210\" fill=\"#f1f4f8\" font-size=\"30\">4</text>\n<text x=\"1280\" y=\"166\" fill=\"#768292\" font-size=\"11\">PROJECTS</text>\n<text x=\"1280\" y=\"210\" fill=\"#f1f4f8\" font-size=\"30\">3</text>\n<text x=\"1430\" y=\"166\" fill=\"#768292\" font-size=\"11\">COVERAGE</text>\n<text x=\"1430\" y=\"210\" fill=\"#f1f4f8\" font-size=\"30\">100%</text>\n<text x=\"1605\" y=\"166\" fill=\"#768292\" font-size=\"11\">LAST EVENT</text>\n<text x=\"1605\" y=\"210\" fill=\"#f1f4f8\" font-size=\"30\">8s</text>\n\n<rect x=\"284\" y=\"268\" width=\"1010\" height=\"454\" rx=\"14\" fill=\"#12171f\" stroke=\"#202833\"/>\n<text x=\"314\" y=\"308\" fill=\"#f1f4f8\" font-size=\"16\" font-weight=\"600\">Active executions</text>\n<text x=\"314\" y=\"342\" fill=\"#768292\" font-size=\"11\">NOW</text>\n<line x1=\"352\" y1=\"380\" x2=\"352\" y2=\"660\" stroke=\"#2a3441\" stroke-width=\"2\"/>\n<circle cx=\"352\" cy=\"402\" r=\"7\" fill=\"#78a9ff\"/>\n<text x=\"382\" y=\"399\" fill=\"#f1f4f8\" font-size=\"14\">Codex · WORK-LAB</text>\n<text x=\"382\" y=\"422\" fill=\"#768292\" font-size=\"12\">Observer projection refactor · running 18m</text>\n<circle cx=\"352\" cy=\"490\" r=\"7\" fill=\"#62c995\"/>\n<text x=\"382\" y=\"487\" fill=\"#f1f4f8\" font-size=\"14\">Hermes · DESIGN-LAB</text>\n<text x=\"382\" y=\"510\" fill=\"#768292\" font-size=\"12\">Validation completed · evidence attached</text>\n<circle cx=\"352\" cy=\"578\" r=\"7\" fill=\"#e3b55b\"/>\n<text x=\"382\" y=\"575\" fill=\"#f1f4f8\" font-size=\"14\">Harness · ArcheAxis</text>\n<text x=\"382\" y=\"598\" fill=\"#768292\" font-size=\"12\">Waiting for CI gate</text>\n\n<rect x=\"1318\" y=\"268\" width=\"554\" height=\"214\" rx=\"14\" fill=\"#12171f\" stroke=\"#202833\"/>\n<text x=\"1348\" y=\"308\" fill=\"#f1f4f8\" font-size=\"16\" font-weight=\"600\">Attention</text>\n<text x=\"1348\" y=\"370\" fill=\"#e3b55b\" font-size=\"13\">1 execution waiting on evidence</text>\n<text x=\"1348\" y=\"404\" fill=\"#768292\" font-size=\"12\">No critical failures</text>\n\n<rect x=\"1318\" y=\"506\" width=\"554\" height=\"216\" rx=\"14\" fill=\"#12171f\" stroke=\"#202833\"/>\n<text x=\"1348\" y=\"546\" fill=\"#f1f4f8\" font-size=\"16\" font-weight=\"600\">Data trust</text>\n<text x=\"1348\" y=\"592\" fill=\"#768292\" font-size=\"12\">Coverage</text>\n<text x=\"1790\" y=\"592\" fill=\"#f1f4f8\" font-size=\"13\" text-anchor=\"end\">100%</text>\n<text x=\"1348\" y=\"626\" fill=\"#768292\" font-size=\"12\">Projection lag</text>\n<text x=\"1790\" y=\"626\" fill=\"#f1f4f8\" font-size=\"13\" text-anchor=\"end\">180 ms</text>\n<text x=\"1348\" y=\"660\" fill=\"#768292\" font-size=\"12\">Unknown values</text>\n<text x=\"1790\" y=\"660\" fill=\"#f1f4f8\" font-size=\"13\" text-anchor=\"end\">0</text>\n\n<rect x=\"284\" y=\"746\" width=\"1588\" height=\"280\" rx=\"14\" fill=\"#12171f\" stroke=\"#202833\"/>\n<text x=\"314\" y=\"786\" fill=\"#f1f4f8\" font-size=\"16\" font-weight=\"600\">Projects</text>\n<text x=\"314\" y=\"842\" fill=\"#f1f4f8\" font-size=\"14\">WORK-LAB</text><text x=\"760\" y=\"842\" fill=\"#62c995\" font-size=\"12\">RUNNING</text><text x=\"990\" y=\"842\" fill=\"#aeb8c5\" font-size=\"12\">main · fadcded</text><text x=\"1450\" y=\"842\" fill=\"#62c995\" font-size=\"12\">CI PASS</text>\n<line x1=\"314\" y1=\"868\" x2=\"1838\" y2=\"868\" stroke=\"#202833\"/>\n<text x=\"314\" y=\"910\" fill=\"#f1f4f8\" font-size=\"14\">DESIGN-LAB</text><text x=\"760\" y=\"910\" fill=\"#78a9ff\" font-size=\"12\">ACTIVE</text>\n<line x1=\"314\" y1=\"936\" x2=\"1838\" y2=\"936\" stroke=\"#202833\"/>\n<text x=\"314\" y=\"978\" fill=\"#f1f4f8\" font-size=\"14\">ArcheAxis</text><text x=\"760\" y=\"978\" fill=\"#e3b55b\" font-size=\"12\">WAITING</text>\n</svg>\n\n**Command Center — Light**\n\n<svg viewBox=\"0 0 1920 1080\" width=\"100%\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"WORK-LAB Command Center light concept\">\n<rect width=\"1920\" height=\"1080\" fill=\"#f5f7fa\"/>\n<rect width=\"248\" height=\"1080\" fill=\"#ffffff\" stroke=\"#e7ebf0\"/>\n<text x=\"34\" y=\"56\" fill=\"#17202b\" font-size=\"24\" font-family=\"sans-serif\" font-weight=\"600\">WORK-LAB</text>\n<text x=\"34\" y=\"84\" fill=\"#7d8997\" font-size=\"12\">OBSERVER</text>\n<text x=\"34\" y=\"160\" fill=\"#17202b\" font-size=\"14\">Overview</text>\n<text x=\"34\" y=\"204\" fill=\"#7d8997\" font-size=\"14\">Projects</text>\n<text x=\"34\" y=\"248\" fill=\"#7d8997\" font-size=\"14\">Executions</text>\n<text x=\"34\" y=\"292\" fill=\"#7d8997\" font-size=\"14\">AI Runtime</text>\n<text x=\"284\" y=\"60\" fill=\"#17202b\" font-size=\"26\" font-weight=\"600\">Command Center</text>\n<rect x=\"284\" y=\"126\" width=\"1588\" height=\"124\" rx=\"14\" fill=\"#ffffff\" stroke=\"#d8dee7\"/>\n<text x=\"314\" y=\"163\" fill=\"#7d8997\" font-size=\"11\">SYSTEM PULSE</text>\n<text x=\"314\" y=\"214\" fill=\"#17202b\" font-size=\"34\" font-weight=\"600\">Everything important, at a glance.</text>\n<rect x=\"284\" y=\"274\" width=\"1010\" height=\"456\" rx=\"14\" fill=\"#ffffff\" stroke=\"#d8dee7\"/>\n<text x=\"314\" y=\"316\" fill=\"#17202b\" font-size=\"16\" font-weight=\"600\">Active executions</text>\n<line x1=\"350\" y1=\"364\" x2=\"350\" y2=\"650\" stroke=\"#d8dee7\" stroke-width=\"2\"/>\n<circle cx=\"350\" cy=\"400\" r=\"7\" fill=\"#4f83d1\"/><text x=\"382\" y=\"405\" fill=\"#17202b\" font-size=\"14\">Codex · WORK-LAB · running</text>\n<circle cx=\"350\" cy=\"490\" r=\"7\" fill=\"#32986b\"/><text x=\"382\" y=\"495\" fill=\"#17202b\" font-size=\"14\">Hermes · DESIGN-LAB · completed</text>\n<circle cx=\"350\" cy=\"580\" r=\"7\" fill=\"#bb822c\"/><text x=\"382\" y=\"585\" fill=\"#17202b\" font-size=\"14\">Harness · ArcheAxis · waiting</text>\n<rect x=\"1318\" y=\"274\" width=\"554\" height=\"216\" rx=\"14\" fill=\"#ffffff\" stroke=\"#d8dee7\"/>\n<text x=\"1348\" y=\"316\" fill=\"#17202b\" font-size=\"16\" font-weight=\"600\">Attention</text>\n<text x=\"1348\" y=\"370\" fill=\"#825915\" font-size=\"13\">1 item needs review</text>\n<rect x=\"1318\" y=\"514\" width=\"554\" height=\"216\" rx=\"14\" fill=\"#ffffff\" stroke=\"#d8dee7\"/>\n<text x=\"1348\" y=\"556\" fill=\"#17202b\" font-size=\"16\" font-weight=\"600\">Trust</text>\n<text x=\"1348\" y=\"610\" fill=\"#536171\" font-size=\"13\">Coverage 100% · Fresh 8s · Lag 180ms</text>\n<rect x=\"284\" y=\"754\" width=\"1588\" height=\"272\" rx=\"14\" fill=\"#ffffff\" stroke=\"#d8dee7\"/>\n<text x=\"314\" y=\"798\" fill=\"#17202b\" font-size=\"16\" font-weight=\"600\">Projects</text>\n<line x1=\"314\" y1=\"848\" x2=\"1838\" y2=\"848\" stroke=\"#e7ebf0\"/>\n<text x=\"314\" y=\"884\" fill=\"#17202b\" font-size=\"14\">WORK-LAB</text><text x=\"900\" y=\"884\" fill=\"#32986b\" font-size=\"12\">RUNNING</text>\n<line x1=\"314\" y1=\"914\" x2=\"1838\" y2=\"914\" stroke=\"#e7ebf0\"/>\n<text x=\"314\" y=\"950\" fill=\"#17202b\" font-size=\"14\">DESIGN-LAB</text><text x=\"900\" y=\"950\" fill=\"#4f83d1\" font-size=\"12\">ACTIVE</text>\n</svg>\n\n**Compact View**\n\n<svg viewBox=\"0 0 1920 1080\" width=\"100%\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"WORK-LAB compact observer concept\">\n<rect width=\"1920\" height=\"1080\" fill=\"#0b0e13\"/>\n<rect x=\"550\" y=\"80\" width=\"820\" height=\"920\" rx=\"20\" fill=\"#12171f\" stroke=\"#2a3441\"/>\n<text x=\"594\" y=\"138\" fill=\"#f1f4f8\" font-size=\"24\" font-weight=\"600\">WORK-LAB</text>\n<circle cx=\"1260\" cy=\"126\" r=\"6\" fill=\"#62c995\"/><text x=\"1277\" y=\"131\" fill=\"#92d9b4\" font-size=\"12\">LIVE</text>\n<text x=\"594\" y=\"205\" fill=\"#768292\" font-size=\"11\">ACTIVE</text><text x=\"594\" y=\"250\" fill=\"#f1f4f8\" font-size=\"34\">3 executions</text>\n<text x=\"1030\" y=\"205\" fill=\"#768292\" font-size=\"11\">ATTENTION</text><text x=\"1030\" y=\"250\" fill=\"#e3b55b\" font-size=\"34\">1</text>\n<line x1=\"594\" y1=\"288\" x2=\"1326\" y2=\"288\" stroke=\"#202833\"/>\n<text x=\"594\" y=\"336\" fill=\"#f1f4f8\" font-size=\"15\">WORK-LAB</text><text x=\"1260\" y=\"336\" fill=\"#62c995\" font-size=\"12\" text-anchor=\"end\">RUNNING</text>\n<text x=\"594\" y=\"374\" fill=\"#768292\" font-size=\"12\">Codex · main · fadcded</text>\n<line x1=\"594\" y1=\"408\" x2=\"1326\" y2=\"408\" stroke=\"#202833\"/>\n<text x=\"594\" y=\"456\" fill=\"#f1f4f8\" font-size=\"15\">DESIGN-LAB</text><text x=\"1260\" y=\"456\" fill=\"#78a9ff\" font-size=\"12\" text-anchor=\"end\">ACTIVE</text>\n<line x1=\"594\" y1=\"488\" x2=\"1326\" y2=\"488\" stroke=\"#202833\"/>\n<text x=\"594\" y=\"536\" fill=\"#f1f4f8\" font-size=\"15\">ArcheAxis</text><text x=\"1260\" y=\"536\" fill=\"#e3b55b\" font-size=\"12\" text-anchor=\"end\">WAITING</text>\n<text x=\"594\" y=\"630\" fill=\"#768292\" font-size=\"11\">LATEST EVENT</text>\n<text x=\"594\" y=\"670\" fill=\"#f1f4f8\" font-size=\"15\">CI evidence attached to WORK-LAB</text>\n<text x=\"594\" y=\"698\" fill=\"#768292\" font-size=\"12\">8 seconds ago</text>\n<rect x=\"594\" y=\"770\" width=\"732\" height=\"118\" rx=\"12\" fill=\"#171d26\"/>\n<text x=\"620\" y=\"810\" fill=\"#768292\" font-size=\"11\">DATA TRUST</text>\n<text x=\"620\" y=\"852\" fill=\"#f1f4f8\" font-size=\"14\">100% coverage</text>\n<text x=\"1040\" y=\"852\" fill=\"#f1f4f8\" font-size=\"14\">180ms lag</text>\n</svg>\n\n**Offline View**\n\n<svg viewBox=\"0 0 1920 1080\" width=\"100%\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"WORK-LAB offline state concept\">\n<rect width=\"1920\" height=\"1080\" fill=\"#0b0e13\"/>\n<text x=\"84\" y=\"76\" fill=\"#f1f4f8\" font-size=\"24\" font-weight=\"600\">WORK-LAB</text>\n<rect x=\"84\" y=\"130\" width=\"1752\" height=\"186\" rx=\"16\" fill=\"#1b1719\" stroke=\"#563438\"/>\n<circle cx=\"124\" cy=\"182\" r=\"8\" fill=\"#e57373\"/>\n<text x=\"150\" y=\"192\" fill=\"#f1f4f8\" font-size=\"28\" font-weight=\"600\">Observer offline</text>\n<text x=\"124\" y=\"235\" fill=\"#aeb8c5\" font-size=\"14\">Live source unavailable. Showing the last verified projection without reinterpreting it as current.</text>\n<text x=\"124\" y=\"278\" fill=\"#768292\" font-size=\"12\">LAST VERIFIED · 14:28:31 · REVISION 829</text>\n<rect x=\"84\" y=\"350\" width=\"1100\" height=\"620\" rx=\"14\" fill=\"#12171f\" stroke=\"#202833\"/>\n<text x=\"120\" y=\"398\" fill=\"#f1f4f8\" font-size=\"16\" font-weight=\"600\">Last verified project state</text>\n<text x=\"120\" y=\"466\" fill=\"#f1f4f8\" font-size=\"15\">WORK-LAB</text><text x=\"970\" y=\"466\" fill=\"#aeb8c5\" font-size=\"12\">STALE · was running</text>\n<line x1=\"120\" y1=\"500\" x2=\"1146\" y2=\"500\" stroke=\"#202833\"/>\n<text x=\"120\" y=\"548\" fill=\"#f1f4f8\" font-size=\"15\">DESIGN-LAB</text><text x=\"970\" y=\"548\" fill=\"#aeb8c5\" font-size=\"12\">STALE · was active</text>\n<rect x=\"1210\" y=\"350\" width=\"626\" height=\"298\" rx=\"14\" fill=\"#12171f\" stroke=\"#202833\"/>\n<text x=\"1246\" y=\"398\" fill=\"#f1f4f8\" font-size=\"16\" font-weight=\"600\">Source health</text>\n<text x=\"1246\" y=\"458\" fill=\"#768292\" font-size=\"12\">Transport</text><text x=\"1768\" y=\"458\" fill=\"#e57373\" font-size=\"12\" text-anchor=\"end\">OFFLINE</text>\n<text x=\"1246\" y=\"500\" fill=\"#768292\" font-size=\"12\">Last good</text><text x=\"1768\" y=\"500\" fill=\"#f1f4f8\" font-size=\"12\" text-anchor=\"end\">14:28:31</text>\n<text x=\"1246\" y=\"542\" fill=\"#768292\" font-size=\"12\">Freshness</text><text x=\"1768\" y=\"542\" fill=\"#e3b55b\" font-size=\"12\" text-anchor=\"end\">STALE</text>\n<text x=\"1246\" y=\"604\" fill=\"#768292\" font-size=\"11\">No bundled fixture is presented as live data.</text>\n</svg>\n\n**Execution Trace Viewer**\n\n<svg viewBox=\"0 0 1920 1080\" width=\"100%\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"WORK-LAB execution trace viewer concept\">\n<rect width=\"1920\" height=\"1080\" fill=\"#0b0e13\"/>\n<rect width=\"248\" height=\"1080\" fill=\"#0e1218\"/>\n<text x=\"34\" y=\"54\" fill=\"#f1f4f8\" font-size=\"24\" font-weight=\"600\">WORK-LAB</text>\n<text x=\"284\" y=\"56\" fill=\"#f1f4f8\" font-size=\"24\" font-weight=\"600\">Execution</text>\n<text x=\"412\" y=\"56\" fill=\"#768292\" font-size=\"13\">exec_01J… · WORK-LAB</text>\n<rect x=\"284\" y=\"104\" width=\"1588\" height=\"110\" rx=\"14\" fill=\"#12171f\" stroke=\"#202833\"/>\n<text x=\"314\" y=\"142\" fill=\"#768292\" font-size=\"11\">TRACE</text>\n<text x=\"314\" y=\"182\" fill=\"#f1f4f8\" font-size=\"20\" font-weight=\"600\">Observer execution-centric projection refactor</text>\n<text x=\"1380\" y=\"150\" fill=\"#768292\" font-size=\"11\">STATUS</text><text x=\"1380\" y=\"182\" fill=\"#78a9ff\" font-size=\"13\">RUNNING</text>\n<text x=\"1530\" y=\"150\" fill=\"#768292\" font-size=\"11\">DURATION</text><text x=\"1530\" y=\"182\" fill=\"#f1f4f8\" font-size=\"13\">18m 42s</text>\n\n<rect x=\"284\" y=\"238\" width=\"1090\" height=\"790\" rx=\"14\" fill=\"#12171f\" stroke=\"#202833\"/>\n<text x=\"314\" y=\"278\" fill=\"#f1f4f8\" font-size=\"16\" font-weight=\"600\">Timeline</text>\n<text x=\"314\" y=\"320\" fill=\"#768292\" font-size=\"11\">14:10</text>\n<line x1=\"430\" y1=\"342\" x2=\"430\" y2=\"958\" stroke=\"#2a3441\" stroke-width=\"2\"/>\n<circle cx=\"430\" cy=\"370\" r=\"8\" fill=\"#78a9ff\"/><text x=\"468\" y=\"366\" fill=\"#f1f4f8\" font-size=\"14\">Hermes · execution started</text><text x=\"468\" y=\"391\" fill=\"#768292\" font-size=\"12\">observed · source workflow</text>\n<circle cx=\"430\" cy=\"474\" r=\"8\" fill=\"#78a9ff\"/><text x=\"468\" y=\"470\" fill=\"#f1f4f8\" font-size=\"14\">Codex · coding agent delegated</text><text x=\"468\" y=\"495\" fill=\"#768292\" font-size=\"12\">agent span · 7m 13s</text>\n<circle cx=\"430\" cy=\"578\" r=\"8\" fill=\"#7ba7e8\"/><text x=\"468\" y=\"574\" fill=\"#f1f4f8\" font-size=\"14\">Git · repository changed</text><text x=\"468\" y=\"599\" fill=\"#768292\" font-size=\"12\">main · fadcded · clean state observed</text>\n<circle cx=\"430\" cy=\"682\" r=\"8\" fill=\"#e3b55b\"/><text x=\"468\" y=\"678\" fill=\"#f1f4f8\" font-size=\"14\">CI · validation running</text><text x=\"468\" y=\"703\" fill=\"#768292\" font-size=\"12\">waiting for evidence</text>\n<circle cx=\"430\" cy=\"786\" r=\"8\" fill=\"#62c995\"/><text x=\"468\" y=\"782\" fill=\"#f1f4f8\" font-size=\"14\">Evidence · unit test attached</text><text x=\"468\" y=\"807\" fill=\"#768292\" font-size=\"12\">trust coverage 1.00</text>\n\n<rect x=\"1398\" y=\"238\" width=\"474\" height=\"790\" rx=\"14\" fill=\"#12171f\" stroke=\"#202833\"/>\n<text x=\"1430\" y=\"278\" fill=\"#f1f4f8\" font-size=\"16\" font-weight=\"600\">Inspector</text>\n<text x=\"1430\" y=\"326\" fill=\"#768292\" font-size=\"11\">SELECTED EVENT</text>\n<text x=\"1430\" y=\"360\" fill=\"#f1f4f8\" font-size=\"14\">CI · validation running</text>\n<text x=\"1430\" y=\"412\" fill=\"#768292\" font-size=\"11\">SOURCE</text><text x=\"1430\" y=\"438\" fill=\"#aeb8c5\" font-size=\"12\">workflow.ci</text>\n<text x=\"1430\" y=\"486\" fill=\"#768292\" font-size=\"11\">SEMANTICS</text><text x=\"1430\" y=\"512\" fill=\"#aeb8c5\" font-size=\"12\">observed</text>\n<text x=\"1430\" y=\"560\" fill=\"#768292\" font-size=\"11\">FRESHNESS</text><text x=\"1430\" y=\"586\" fill=\"#aeb8c5\" font-size=\"12\">3.2s</text>\n<text x=\"1430\" y=\"634\" fill=\"#768292\" font-size=\"11\">COVERAGE</text><text x=\"1430\" y=\"660\" fill=\"#aeb8c5\" font-size=\"12\">1.00</text>\n<text x=\"1430\" y=\"708\" fill=\"#768292\" font-size=\"11\">EVIDENCE</text><text x=\"1430\" y=\"734\" fill=\"#62c995\" font-size=\"12\">2 attached</text>\n</svg>\n\n最重要的视觉变化，不是圆角和颜色，而是**视觉主语从 KPI 变成 Execution 和 Evidence**。\n\n## 执行任务包、测试、迁移与风险\n\n建议把这次工作正式定义为：\n\n`WL-OBS-EXECUTION-CONTROL-PLANE`\n\nbaseline：\n\n```text\nfadcded4c4db8d6e1543e078b67cb746f0159a1f\n```\n\n不要在 `main` 直接连续做第六、第七次视觉 patch。\n\n**DeepSeek Harness TaskPack：**\n\n| 阶段 | 任务 | 主要文件 | 测试 | Acceptance Gate |\n|---|---|---|---|---|\n| Phase 1 | 冻结 baseline、逐 blob inventory、确认 build/test contract | 根目录、AGENTS、CI、30-observer | existing full gate | 所有现状证据有 SHA；零功能修改 |\n| Phase 1 | 数据来源矩阵：每个 current field → collector/source/projection/UI | `src/**`, `schemas/**`, `web/**` | provenance audit | 每个可见 KPI 都可追源 |\n| Phase 1 | 建立 truth invariants | tests | contract tests | null/unknown/live/stale 全部锁定 |\n| Phase 2 | 新增 Execution-centric schema v3 | `schemas/execution-projection.schema.json` | JSON Schema tests | v3 schema valid |\n| Phase 2 | v2→v3 compatibility adapter | proposed `src/projection/**` | golden fixture diff | v2 不被破坏 |\n| Phase 2 | Execution Graph Builder | backend projection | unit/integration | agent/model/tool/event 可关联 |\n| Phase 2 | Trust Enricher | backend projection | freshness/provenance tests | 每个 measurement 有 trust |\n| Phase 2 | reconciliation / duplicate / dropped counters | backend | fault injection | 数据质量可量化 |\n| Phase 3 | 前端 shell / route / selectors | `web/scripts/**` | renderer tests | renderer 不再直接做业务推导 |\n| Phase 3 | 拆 `fusion-v3.js` | `web/scripts/views/**`, `components/**` | snapshot DOM tests | 删除重复 Project surfaces |\n| Phase 3 | design tokens | `web/styles/tokens.css` | visual smoke | 无组件自定义状态色 |\n| Phase 3 | Command Center | views/components | Playwright | 3 秒可识别 overall/active/blocked/trust |\n| Phase 4 | Project Workspace | views/components | UI integration | 项目上下文完整 |\n| Phase 4 | Execution Trace Viewer | views/components | timeline tests | event/source/evidence 可追溯 |\n| Phase 4 | AI Runtime | views/components/charts | null/usage tests | 无数据绝不显示 0 |\n| Phase 4 | Delivery / CI | views/components | CI fixture tests | UNKNOWN ≠ PASS |\n| Phase 4 | Trust Center | views/components | trust fixture tests | provenance 可 inspect |\n| Phase 5 | Compact / Offline | views | offline tests | last-good 和 offline 语义正确 |\n| Phase 5 | native SVG chart upgrade | `charts.js` 或新 chart module | SVG/a11y tests | 无新 chart runtime dependency |\n| Phase 5 | WCAG 2.2 AA | accessibility + views | keyboard/axe/manual | 无 color-only status |\n| Phase 5 | Responsive | styles | 1920/1600/1366/900 | 无 overflow、无内容截断 |\n| Phase 6 | visual regression | Playwright | screenshot compare | 5 个基准视图通过 |\n| Phase 6 | Tauri smoke/build | `src-tauri/**` + CI | build launch smoke | desktop build 可启动 |\n| Phase 6 | dual projection validation | backend/tests | live-shadow validation | v3 与 v2 invariant 对齐 |\n| Phase 6 | cut-over + rollback docs | docs/taskpack | final gate | 一条命令/一 commit 可 rollback |\n\n当前 `charts.js` 原生 SVG 方向应保留。fileciteturn0file0L1-L4 `api.js` / `state.js` 默认列入 Frozen Zone，因为它们已经承载真实性边界。fileciteturn0file7L1-L10 fileciteturn0file5L68-L97\n\n建议 Git 操作规范：\n\n```bash\ngit switch main\ngit pull --ff-only\n\nBASELINE=fadcded4c4db8d6e1543e078b67cb746f0159a1f\ngit rev-parse HEAD\n\ngit switch -c refactor/observer-execution-control-plane\n\n# Phase commits should remain separable:\n# 1. audit/schema\n# 2. projection\n# 3. frontend architecture\n# 4. views\n# 5. validation\n# 6. docs/cutover\n```\n\n禁止：\n\n```text\nforce push main\nreset --hard 用户未提交修改\n把 schema migration 与纯视觉 patch 混成一个巨大 commit\n为了 UI 改写 trust boundary\n在旧 snapshot 尚未可 rollback 前删除 v2\n把 demo fixture 作为 production fallback\n```\n\n建议 PR 模板：\n\n```markdown\n# WORK-LAB Observer Refactor\n\n## Baseline\n\n- Repository: DTALEX66/WORK-LAB\n- Baseline SHA:\n- Branch:\n- TaskPack:\n\n## Scope\n\n- [ ] Projection\n- [ ] Schema\n- [ ] Frontend\n- [ ] Visual system\n- [ ] Accessibility\n- [ ] Tests\n- [ ] Documentation\n\n## Truth Contract\n\n- [ ] null is not rendered as zero\n- [ ] UNKNOWN is not rendered as healthy\n- [ ] OFFLINE is not rendered as LIVE\n- [ ] STALE visibly identifies last-good data\n- [ ] fixture cannot impersonate production\n- [ ] source / freshness / semantics preserved\n- [ ] sensitive fields are not exposed\n\n## Schema\n\nOld version:\nNew version:\nCompatibility adapter:\nRollback path:\n\n## Validation Evidence\n\nUnit:\nIntegration:\nSchema:\nVisual:\nAccessibility:\nTauri smoke:\nCI:\n\n## Visual Evidence\n\n- dark 1920\n- light 1920\n- 1366\n- compact\n- offline\n- execution trace\n\n## Risk\n\nData contract:\nSecurity:\nMigration:\nPerformance:\nAccessibility:\n\n## Rollback\n\nRollback commit:\nSchema fallback:\nProjection fallback:\nFrontend fallback:\n```\n\n**Truth tests 必须优先于截图测试。** 至少固定以下不变量：\n\n```javascript\ndescribe(\"observer truth semantics\", () => {\n  it(\"must not convert null token usage to zero\", () => {\n    const result = formatObservedMetric({\n      value: null,\n      trust: {\n        semantics: \"unknown\",\n        source: \"usage-ledger\",\n        lastSeen: null,\n        freshnessMs: null,\n        coverage: 0\n      }\n    });\n\n    expect(result.label).not.toBe(\"0\");\n    expect(result.state).toBe(\"unknown\");\n  });\n\n  it(\"must not treat UNKNOWN CI as PASS\", () => {\n    expect(ciStatusMeta(\"UNKNOWN\").semantic).toBe(\"unknown\");\n    expect(ciStatusMeta(\"UNKNOWN\").semantic).not.toBe(\"success\");\n  });\n\n  it(\"must preserve last-good when live refresh fails\", () => {\n    const previous = verifiedProjection({ revision: 829 });\n    const next = transitionAfterRefreshFailure(previous);\n\n    expect(next.data).toEqual(previous.data);\n    expect(next.transport).not.toBe(\"LIVE\");\n    expect(next.stale).toBe(true);\n  });\n\n  it(\"must never fallback from production LIVE failure to fixture\", () => {\n    const next = transitionAfterLiveFailure({\n      lastGood: null,\n      fixtureAvailable: true\n    });\n\n    expect(next.transport).toBe(\"OFFLINE\");\n    expect(next.source).not.toBe(\"FIXTURE\");\n  });\n});\n```\n\n这与当前上传版本的真实设计意图一致：LIVE 获取失败不能由 fixture 冒充。fileciteturn0file8L271-L307\n\n**Projection tests 应增加不变量：**\n\n```text\nprojectionRevision monotonic\nevent IDs unique\nexecution → project reference valid\nevent → execution reference valid\nevidence → execution reference valid\nmeasurement semantics mandatory\nestimated cost requires pricingVersion\nobservedAt <= generatedAt\nfreshnessMs cannot be negative\ncoverage ∈ [0, 1]\nunknown value cannot silently become zero\nduplicate event does not double-count usage\nout-of-order event does not regress final state\nstale source is explicitly flagged\n```\n\n**视觉回归建议使用 Playwright，但它是新增测试基础设施，不应被误认为当前仓库已经具备。**\n\n```javascript\n// tests/visual/observer.spec.mjs\nimport { test, expect } from \"@playwright/test\";\n\nconst cases = [\n  [\"command-dark\", \"/visual/live.html?theme=dark\", 1920, 1080],\n  [\"command-light\", \"/visual/live.html?theme=light\", 1920, 1080],\n  [\"compact\", \"/visual/compact.html\", 900, 1080],\n  [\"offline\", \"/visual/offline.html\", 1920, 1080],\n  [\"trace\", \"/visual/trace.html\", 1920, 1080]\n];\n\nfor (const [name, path, width, height] of cases) {\n  test(name, async ({ page }) => {\n    await page.setViewportSize({ width, height });\n    await page.goto(path);\n\n    await expect(page.locator(\"[data-observer-ready='true']\"))\n      .toBeVisible();\n\n    await expect(page).toHaveScreenshot(`${name}.png`, {\n      fullPage: true,\n      animations: \"disabled\"\n    });\n  });\n}\n```\n\n这里建议做一个**测试专用静态 fixture host**，不要让生产 `api.js` 多出“为了截图可以假装 LIVE”的隐藏路径。Production truth contract 和 visual fixture 必须完全隔离。\n\n性能目标可以定为：\n\n| 指标 | Gate |\n|---|---:|\n| 首次 shell 可见 | ≤ 500 ms，本机 production build |\n| 已有 snapshot 首屏可用 | ≤ 800 ms |\n| 100 executions render | ≤ 100 ms scripting budget |\n| 1,000 timeline events 初次可见 | ≤ 250 ms，必要时 virtualize |\n| SSE 单事件 UI update | ≤ 16–32 ms 主线程预算 |\n| Layout shift | 接近 0 |\n| dashboard idle animation | 0 个持续高频 animation |\n| keyboard navigation | 所有核心功能可到达 |\n\n这些是**重构验收目标**，不是对当前版本实测结果。\n\n建议 CI 最终形成：\n\n```mermaid\nflowchart LR\n    PR[\"Pull Request\"]\n    GOV[\"Governance checks\"]\n    PY[\"Backend unit\"]\n    SCH[\"Schema compatibility\"]\n    FE[\"Frontend unit\"]\n    TR[\"Truth contract\"]\n    A11[\"Accessibility\"]\n    VIS[\"Visual regression\"]\n    TA[\"Tauri build smoke\"]\n    MERGE[\"Merge eligible\"]\n\n    PR --> GOV\n    GOV --> PY\n    PY --> SCH\n    SCH --> FE\n    FE --> TR\n    TR --> A11\n    A11 --> VIS\n    VIS --> TA\n    TA --> MERGE\n```\n\n云端已确认 `.github/workflows/work-lab-ci.yml` 存在，但由于其正文没有在本次证据集中完整展开，不能声称现有 CI 已经覆盖或没有覆盖这些 Gate。[CI workflow @ baseline](https://github.com/DTALEX66/WORK-LAB/blob/fadcded4c4db8d6e1543e078b67cb746f0159a1f/.github/workflows/work-lab-ci.yml)\n\n**迁移工作量以人日估算：**\n\n| 工作 | 人日 |\n|---|---:|\n| 完整 blob 审计、source matrix、字段 lineage | 3–4 |\n| Projection v3 schema + compatibility | 3–5 |\n| Execution Graph / Trust enrichment backend | 5–8 |\n| 前端架构拆分 + design system | 4–6 |\n| Command Center / Project / Delivery / Trust | 5–7 |\n| Trace Viewer / AI Runtime | 5–8 |\n| Compact / Offline / responsive / light mode | 2–4 |\n| Truth / integration / accessibility tests | 3–5 |\n| Visual regression / Tauri smoke / CI | 2–4 |\n| migration / dual-run / docs / cutover | 2–3 |\n| **总计** | **34–54 人日** |\n\n这是偏工程质量优先的估算。若只做 MVP，可压缩为约 **15–22 人日**：\n\n```text\nMVP\n=\nProjection v3 compatibility\n+ Execution\n+ provenance/freshness\n+ Command Center\n+ Trace Viewer\n+ Delivery\n+ Trust Center\n+ dark mode\n+ truth tests\n```\n\nLight mode、复杂 AI telemetry、通用 panel schema、完整 visual regression 可以第二阶段进入。\n\n主要风险与降级策略：\n\n| 风险 | 影响 | 降级方案 |\n|---|---|---|\n| Workflow upstream 没有 execution ID | 无法稳定构建 trace | Projection 生成 deterministic correlation ID，并标记 `derived` |\n| Agent/model/tool 事件数据不足 | Trace 不完整 | 展示 partial execution，coverage 明确，不补假 span |\n| Token 数据源不统一 | 总量错误 | 每 source 独立 measurement；不强行求和 |\n| Cost 无可靠 pricing | 金额误导 | 不显示 cost，或明确 `estimated + pricingVersion` |\n| GitHub/CI 权限不完整 | Delivery partial | `unknown/source-unavailable`，绝不 PASS |\n| 敏感内容不能进入 Observer | Trace 信息过少 | 只显示 operation metadata、sanitized label、evidence refs |\n| v3 migration 破坏现版 | 发布风险 | v2/v3 dual projection + compatibility adapter |\n| 前端一次性框架迁移 | 工程风险 | 先保持现技术路线，ES modules/component split |\n| 大规模视觉重构造成 a11y 回归 | 产品质量倒退 | WCAG/keyboard/visual 都做 merge gate |\n| UI 快速连续 patch | 架构继续漂移 | 先 freeze IA + schema + tokens，再允许 page implementation |\n\n最关键的产品判断是：\n\n> **WORK-LAB 不缺更多 Dashboard 卡片，它缺的是一个能够把 Project、Agent、Model、Tool、Git、CI、Evidence 和 Governance 串成一次真实 Execution 的观察模型。**\n\n当前 Observer 最好的部分其实不是视觉，而是它已经形成的 truth-first 边界：GET-only、受验证的 LIVE、last-good、STALE/OFFLINE、null/UNKNOWN 防伪语义。fileciteturn0file7L1-L10 fileciteturn0file5L68-L97\n\n所以正确重构不是：\n\n```text\nWORK-LAB Observer\n→ 换颜色\n→ 换卡片\n→ 加图表\n→ 再做 v4 UI\n```\n\n而应该是：\n\n```text\nWORK-LAB Observer\n\nTruth Boundary             保留\n        ↓\nExecution Projection       重构\n        ↓\nProvenance / Trust         强化\n        ↓\nFrontend IA                全量重做\n        ↓\nDesign System              全量重做\n        ↓\nCommand Center             新建\n        ↓\nTrace Viewer               新建\n        ↓\nAI Runtime                 新建\n        ↓\nDelivery                   重组\n        ↓\nTrust Center               升级为核心产品能力\n```\n\n**当前唯一未达到你要求的硬性交付项，是“云端 main 每一个 blob 正文逐行读取并为所有文件生成完整 SHA inventory”这一项；本轮已验证云端仓库、main 基线、最新提交、recursive tree 及部分 blob，但证据集中没有完整展开整个 tree 后半部和所有文件正文。因此本文明确不把未读文件伪装成已审计。** 对 WORK-LAB 这样的 truth-first 项目，这个边界本身也应该遵守它自己的原则。"]},"status":"finished_successfully","end_turn":true,"weight":1.0,"metadata":{"finish_details":{"type":"stop","stop_tokens":[200002]},"is_complete":true,"citations":[{"start_ix":3886,"end_ix":3914,"citation_format_type":"berry_file_search","metadata":{"type":"file","name":"api.js","id":"file_00000000dc3481fbb61cffc95084aecc","source":"my_files","text":null,"extra":{"retrieval_turn":0,"retrieval_file_index":7,"cited_message_idx":46,"cited_message_id":"ac9ed1d8-6ccb-4894-9228-c73666d882e9","search_result_idx":null,"line_range":[1,10],"cloud_doc_url":null,"library_file_id":"libfile_6c63700e952c8191a15f2f25a07396a6","authors_display":null,"doi":null,"publication_year":null,"journal_name":null,"source_label":null,"journal_homepage_url":null,"source_url":null,"source_icon_url":null,"set_id":null,"spl_version":null,"run_id":null,"title":null,"effective_time":null}}},{"start_ix":3978,"end_ix":4007,"citation_format_type":"berry_file_search","metadata":{"type":"file","name":"state.js","id":"file_0000000045e881fba6f0c698e6